        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjU_kf2i9IpSKsULLwSG9oXb-Fd74jGsmwkQWe35RpjPrP4pIoFpug=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 months ago",
        "text": "Had a flat tire on my way to an appointment. The garage was able to fit me in due to the emergency even though they were fully booked. Peter and his team are super courteous and helpful, they provided very quick service. I highly recommend them.",
        "time": 1764166791,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Michael Moore",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107615401728331768430/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJ_FTNjyzfW3VOKClBLpr5NLf4BqVAZNVHevuPDbt-JKmAkDg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "3 months ago",
        "text": "I have given this garage lots of my business. Only because I am a loyal person I even brought my cars from new brunswick to have them service my 3 cars . But they will never see a penny from me again. You will find better service and experience from canadian tire. I brought  my BMW in for engine gaskets to be replaced after about a mouth  being at the garage the issue of oil leaks still there . I was also having drivetrain issues because a tireshop put on the wrong size tire  they took on the job to fix the issue and clearly they didn't know what they were doing and i am still having those issues.\n\nI also took my Dodge 3500 to have my breaks done it cost me over 800$ and left with rear axels Hubs  leaking and I also noticed that when I made a left turn there was hesitations. Come to find out that my break lines were twisted and was pinching.\n\nSo if you like tossing your money away and like visiting that garage on a monthly basis. Go to this garage. Or take my advice and find another one honesty and integrity in a garage is very important. And they check none of those boxes for me.\n\nHaha pay for the transfer case repair is that a joke? It was not repaired it still does what it was doing (SLIPPING) And in fact if you remember I had to take it to another garage because you clearly didn't know what you were doing. Clients cars shouldn't be an experiment for work you have never done.",
        "time": 1762617751,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Dinesh Mahtani",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114847593675407271525/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJA0aAdcgn945fD9rpcxvtUJNRsAyJbxpxQcnzp_8f6T4OGow=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "I have been a customer of Peter at GCA garage for over 10 years, they have to be one of the most upfront, fair and honest people I know, Peter is detailed when explaining any issue with your vehicle. We have done all types of repairs and servicing on our cars as we have 4 cars, the latest job was adding new winter tires and rims, great job at a fair price. We always feel safe and comfortable when we leave his garage, Peter, keep up the great work.",
        "time": 1699711693,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Laurence Montreuil",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105915063529055025113/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLOAARJK3J5aN5ErxIwtDnyZIb_mNdVnB81nyoBx4G-jD1dDw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 years ago",
        "text": "I have been going to this garage since I got my first car when I was 17 years old. Peter is always honest, available, and goes out of his way to make sure my car is taken care of, and safe to drive. I can’t say enough nice things about their team. They are reliable, professional, and affordable! Don’t hesitate to give them a call, you won’t be disappointed.",
        "time": 1653869073,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
